# --- Benchmark data (large; obtained separately, see Benchmark/README.md) ---
# The PlaceReasoner-Bench design data is ~589 MB and is not tracked here.
# Its documentation (Benchmark/PlaceReasoner-Bench/README.md) IS tracked.
Benchmark/PlaceReasoner-Bench/*/
!Benchmark/PlaceReasoner-Bench/README.md

# --- Secrets ---
# Never commit a real API key. Use the .example template or $OPENAI_API_KEY.
API_key/*
!API_key/*.example
!API_key/README.md

# --- Run artifacts ---
output/
work/
*.log

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editor / OS ---
*.orig
*.swp
.DS_Store
